{
    "reasoner_response": "Acknowledge that the customer has a 2020 HONDA ACCORD on file. Recommend starting with their selling dealer, Texas Auto Group, who can be reached at 214-555-0100, as they are familiar with the contract and can work directly with Assurant. Advise that if the selling dealer is unavailable or the customer prefers another shop, their contract may require them to return to the selling dealer, and they can confirm acceptable repair locations at vehicle care plan dot com. Inform the customer that the repair facility (not the customer) must contact Assurant to initiate and authorize the claim process before repairs begin. Guide them through the steps: 1) Take the vehicle to a repair facility (selling dealer preferred, or any repair location found on vehicle care plan dot com), 2) The repair facility contacts Assurant to get the claim authorized, 3) Assurant reviews and authorizes covered repairs. Remind them that coverage is determined case-by-case at claim authorization and do not confirm any specific repair is covered. If the customer needs help locating a repair facility, let them know they can find one online at vehicle care plan dot com. If they insist on speaking to a human agent for repair facility location or related guidance, call me back with their request and context.",
